{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Game About Automation</strong> is a casual factory creation game in which your goal is to produce numbers and deliver those that are requested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/145ac6f47577921f1fdc98919f69701e.avif?t=1773241113\" width=378 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver</strong> the requested numbers to advance, unlocking new operations and improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/65e80e27d66d2f7fd5e537a19016b2b7.poster.avif?t=1773241113\" width=920 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/65e80e27d66d2f7fd5e537a19016b2b7.webm?t=1773241113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/65e80e27d66d2f7fd5e537a19016b2b7.mp4?t=1773241113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926510/extras/4285f26b25f1fd4036bc1fee4cdc562c.avif?t=1773241113\" width=378 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use splitters, mergers or bridges to find the best solution in the distribution chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c